# Mentor (CR 702.134a, 608.2b): two Blade Instructors (3/1) attack with Isamaru (2/2). Each mentor's only creature of lesser power
# is Isamaru - the other Instructor has equal power, which is not less - so both triggers target it. The first resolves and
# Isamaru is 3/3; as the second resolves Isamaru's power is no longer less than 3, its target is illegal and it does nothing
# (the ruling's own example): one counter, not two. Black Lotus, Mox Pearl and Plains pay for the creatures.

